        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[This week in PSC (241) | 2026-11-02]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[The Perl Steering Council released "This week in PSC (241)", which discusses their deliberations on issue GH24977 pertaining to changes to regexp interpolation while using strict in blead Perl. In the opinion of the Council, the changes proposed require more consideration and refinement before the next stable release of the software, in an otherwise uneventful week regarding issues discussed in the issue tracker and mailing list.]]></description>
